    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;There are rules for chestmaking. If you see a chest that doesn't follow the rules, it probably wants to eat you.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tony, Master Sleuth</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedual chest generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the rules and enter them into your rulebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades and new items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ dungeons to get eaten in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ chest types to make your brain go ouchie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode and Time Challenges</p></li></ul>",
